    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bordermind</strong> is a horror-themed FPS with a unique retro style that captures the essence of the '90s and 2000s, both visually and structurally, delivering a one-of-a-kind experience with the spirit of classic games. Feel like you're playing on a PSX, PS1, or even classic Raycasting-era games\u2014all at once, but with the smoothness and comfort of modern technology in a gameplay experience uniquely developed by us. No long tutorials, no overly complicated maps, no unnecessary fluff: here, the focus is on satisfying shootouts, within a captivating story and an intriguing plot twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Features:</strong><br>\u2022 Retro aesthetic inspired by the 32-bit era and Raycasting<br>\u2022 Immersive, dark, and mysterious horror atmosphere<br>\u2022 Gameplay focused on fun and satisfaction<br>\u2022 Well-balanced jumpscares<br>\u2022 Carefully crafted by fans of classic shooters<br>\u2022 Perfect for those looking for something different \u2013 new, yet nostalgic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the death of your wife, you realize you need to speak to her again. To do so, you seek out a device used during World War II to contact the dead and enter an intermediary world between the material and the spiritual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll have to face what comes from the darkness, deal with the remnants of fallen soldiers, confront your own fears, and find a way to go even deeper\u2014until you reach your deceased wife.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bordermind</strong> is a horror-themed FPS with a unique retro style that captures the essence of the '90s and 2000s, both visually and structurally, delivering a one-of-a-kind experience with the spirit of classic games. Feel like you're playing on a PSX, PS1, or even classic Raycasting-era games\u2014all at once, but with the smoothness and comfort of modern technology in a gameplay experience uniquely developed by us. No long tutorials, no overly complicated maps, no unnecessary fluff: here, the focus is on satisfying shootouts, within a captivating story and an intriguing plot twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Features:</strong><br>\u2022 Retro aesthetic inspired by the 32-bit era and Raycasting<br>\u2022 Immersive, dark, and mysterious horror atmosphere<br>\u2022 Gameplay focused on fun and satisfaction<br>\u2022 Well-balanced jumpscares<br>\u2022 Carefully crafted by fans of classic shooters<br>\u2022 Perfect for those looking for something different \u2013 new, yet nostalgic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the death of your wife, you realize you need to speak to her again. To do so, you seek out a device used during World War II to contact the dead and enter an intermediary world between the material and the spiritual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll have to face what comes from the darkness, deal with the remnants of fallen soldiers, confront your own fears, and find a way to go even deeper\u2014until you reach your deceased wife.</p>",
    "short_description": "Tired of playing fancy games that have lost all their mystery? Looking for something different? Look no further. Bordermind is a retro horror-themed FPS with a PSX/PS1 aesthetic. It takes the player into an intermediary world between the material and the spiritual.",
